/images/enlarge.svg?1788406861\"/></button><div data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/17043928/index.html?v=1782537951&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\" class=\"iframe_placeholder\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"donate\"><a href=\"https://versaliate.itch.io/versari/purchase\" class=\"button donate_btn\" data-donate=\"false\">Download Now</a></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>Versari</p>\r\n<p>Build your colony from nothing.</p>\r\n<p>Versari is a pixel-art colony simulation where you guide a small tribe of beings called</p>\r\n<p>Versari as they survive and grow in the wilderness.</p>\r\n<p>Gather. Build. Expand.</p>\r\n<p>Start with one Versari and nothing else. Collect resources, construct buildings, and expand your territory as your colony grows.</p>\r\n<p>Features</p>\r\n<p>- 8 Unique Buildings - From the Vorran (storage) to the Petralix (stone circle), each structure serves a vital purpose</p>\r\n<p>- Dynamic Needs System - Your Versari have hunger, thirst, and energy - keep them satisfied to maintain productivity</p>\r\n<p>- Territory 